# Data Directory Layout

**All persisted data lives under `backend/data/`**, NOT at the repo root `data/`.

The `OHLCVStore`, `OptionsChainStore`, `OptionsHistoryStore`, `HistoricalIVStore`, `DerivedMetricsStore`, and all other data stores resolve paths relative to `backend/data/`.

## Directory Map

| Store | Path | Format |
|-------|------|--------|
| Daily OHLCV bars | `backend/data/ohlcv_daily/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Intraday 5-min bars | `backend/data/intraday_5min/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Ticker metadata | `backend/data/ticker_meta.parquet` | Single file (market cap, type, exchange, sector, SIC, institutional ownership) |
| Options chain snapshots (Tradier) | `backend/data/options_chains/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Options history (S3 flat files) | `backend/data/options_history/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Historical IV (ATM put) | `backend/data/options_iv/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Derived metrics (IV Rank, VRP) | `backend/data/derived/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Conviction signals cache | `backend/data/conviction_signals.parquet` | Single file |
| ETF constituents | `backend/data/etf_constituents.parquet` | Single file |
| Correlations | `backend/data/correlations.parquet` | Pairwise top-N peers |
| Betas | `backend/data/betas.parquet` | Per-ticker SPY/QQQ betas |
| ML models | `backend/data/ml/models/` | XGBoost `.json` + `_meta.json` |
| ML dataset | `backend/data/ml/dataset.parquet` | Training dataset |
| News articles | `backend/data/news_articles/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| 8-K filings | `backend/data/filings_8k/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Insider transactions | `backend/data/insider_transactions/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |

## SQLite Databases

| DB | Path | Purpose |
|----|------|---------|
| Config | `backend/db/config.db` | User-editable operational settings |
| Conviction | `backend/db/conviction.db` | Conviction snapshots (source of truth for page loads) |
| Positions | `backend/data/positions.db` | Stock positions (`StockPosition`) and exit signals (`ExitSignal`) |
| Backtest | `backend/db/backtest.db` | Pullback events and ticker pullback profiles (simulation data only) |
| Scans | `backend/db/scans.db` | Scanner results persistence |
| Candidates | `backend/db/candidates.db` | CSP candidate persistence |
| Analyses | `backend/db/analyses.db` | LLM analysis persistence |
| News | `backend/db/news.db` | News/filing signals |

## Python Access

All scripts run from `backend/` as cwd: `cd backend && .venv/bin/python scripts/...`

The `.venv` is at `backend/.venv/`. Use `backend/.venv/bin/python` (or activate the venv) to run scripts.

When reading data programmatically in ad-hoc scripts, use the stores:

```python
from tyche.market_data.data_store import OHLCVStore
store = OHLCVStore(data_dir='data')
df = store.read_ticker('PL')
```

Other stores follow the same pattern:

```python
from tyche.market_data.options_history_store import OptionsHistoryStore
from tyche.market_data.derived_store import DerivedMetricsStore
from tyche.market_data.data_store import TickerMetaStore
```

## Key Ingestion Scripts

| Script | Purpose | Example |
|--------|---------|---------|
| `ingest_data.py` | OHLCV daily bars from Polygon | `--from 2026-04-20 --to 2026-04-20 --no-conviction` |
| `ingest_options_flatfiles.py` | Options history from Massive S3 flat files + IV/derived metrics | `--from-ohlcv --include-today --days-back 3` |
| `bridge_tradier_iv.py` | Bridge Tradier snapshots to IV pipeline (same-day) | Run after `ingest_options.py` |

## Tradier Client Setup

```python
from tyche.broker.tradier.client import TradierClient
from tyche.config import get_settings

settings = get_settings()
client = TradierClient(
    api_token=settings.tradier_api_token,
    account_id=settings.tradier_account_id,
    base_url=settings.tradier_base_url or 'https://api.tradier.com',
)
```
